en:
(Ka) The triad, and the excellent Paṭṭhāna, the supreme dyad;
The pair and the triad, the triad and the pair;
The triad and the triad, the pair and the pair;
Six modes in the forward order are very profound.

(Kha) The triad, the excellent Exposition, and the supreme dyad;
The pair and the triad, and the triad and the pair;
The triad and the triad, and the pair and the pair;
Six methods in the negation are very profound.

(Ga) The triad, and the excellent Paṭṭhāna, the supreme dyad;
The pair and the triad, the triad and the pair;
The triad and the triad, the pair and the pair;
Six methods in the affirmative-negative order are very profound.
